    "input_texts": [
      "Title: Sort Asset List by Function and Close Task\nDescription: Step-by-step workflow to sort the Asset List by 'Asset function' and mark the associated task as complete.\n- Navigate to the 'All Assets' view from the 'All' menu in the top navigation bar.\n- Click the 'Show / hide filter' button to expand the filter panel.\n- Click the 'Add Sort' button to open the sorting configuration.\n- Select the 'Order results by the following fields' combobox.\n- Choose 'Asset function' from the dropdown list and press Enter to confirm.\n- Click the 'Run filter' button to apply the sorting criteria.\n- Navigate to the task record and set the 'State' field to 'Closed Complete'.\n- Click the 'Update' button to save the task status change."
